/S /H1
/T (A recent survey conducted by TIRDO in collaboration with REPOA  revealed that poor technology and inadequate knowledge also  contribute to production of poor briquettes, which in turn, are  rejected by customers and users. Therefore, improving the quality  of biomass briquettes is very important in order to substitute wood  fuels. This handbook outlines steps to take in order to produce high- quality biomass briquettes. )
