/T (2.1.1 Biomass Materials  The steps that can be followed to source and collect raw materials  for biomass briquetting include identification of potential source;  assessment of the quality and availability; and collection of raw  materials as detailed below: )
/E (2.1.1 Biomass Materials  The steps that can be followed to source and collect raw materials  for biomass briquetting include identification of potential source;  assessment of the quality and availability; and collection of raw  materials as detailed below: )
