/T (Molasses is a by-product of the sugar refining process. Molasses can be bought directly from sugar industry or specific supplier at the market. Briquettes bound by molasses burn well, but they have unpleasant smell during combustion. In order to avoid this, thermal treatment \(curing\) can be applied before using such briquettes. )
