/T (Biomass Briquetting Handbook  However, as mentioned earlier, prolonged exposure to sunlight causes the briquettes to deteriorate and lose their structural integrity, so it is important to monitor them closely and bring them inside if there is a risk of rain or strong sunlight. This method is weather dependent hence it might result into prolonged drying period \(Figure 2.8\). )
