/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (4.1.1 Sustainable Supply of Raw Materials  Sustainability is a critical factor to consider when sourcing biomass  raw materials for briquetting. It is essential to ensure that the  biomass is sourced in a way that it does not have a short and long- term negative impact on the environment. Some of the key  sustainability considerations include: )
/E (4.1.1 Sustainable Supply of Raw Materials  Sustainability is a critical factor to consider when sourcing biomass  raw materials for briquetting. It is essential to ensure that the  biomass is sourced in a way that it does not have a short and long- term negative impact on the environment. Some of the key  sustainability considerations include: )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
