852 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (It is essential to ensure that biomass is sourced from land that is not  being used for food production or for other critical purposes such  as conservation or cultural practices. The land should also be used  in a way that does not degrade the soil or cause erosion, which can  lead to long-term land degradation. )
/E (It is essential to ensure that biomass is sourced from land that is not  being used for food production or for other critical purposes such  as conservation or cultural practices. The land should also be used  in a way that does not degrade the soil or cause erosion, which can  lead to long-term land degradation. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
