854 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The sourcing of biomass should not have a negative impact on the  biodiversity of the area. This means, the harvesting of biomass  should be done in a way that does not damage the habitat of  wildlife or the ecosystem. )
/E (The sourcing of biomass should not have a negative impact on the  biodiversity of the area. This means, the harvesting of biomass  should be done in a way that does not damage the habitat of  wildlife or the ecosystem. )
/Pg 47 0 R
