<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The sourcing and transportation of biomass should be done in a way that does not result in excessive greenhouse gas emissions. This can be achieved by using sustainable transportation methods such as trains or ships instead of trucks. Sourcing biomass from local areas will cut down on the transport cost and minimize resulting greenhouse gas emissions. )
/E (The sourcing and transportation of biomass should be done in a way that does not result in excessive greenhouse gas emissions. This can be achieved by using sustainable transportation methods such as trains or ships instead of trucks. Sourcing biomass from local areas will cut down on the transport cost and minimize resulting greenhouse gas emissions. )
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [3]
>>
